---
# Domestic node. It is the only ingress that stays reachable from inside the
# restricted network, so it fronts every chain leaving the country — and it
# never egresses on a user's behalf except on its own test chain.
ansible_host: 203.0.113.10

# Names angie terminates TLS for, and that the certificate covers. The first is
# this node's primary: chains and subscription links address it by that name.
# The apex is an alias shared with the other nodes — several A records under
# one name, which visitors round-robin between. Certificates come over dns-01,
# so sharing a name across nodes costs nothing: each node proves ownership by
# writing a TXT record, not by being the one the name resolves to.
#
# Read across plays through hostvars, so it belongs in the inventory rather
# than in a role's defaults.
vpn_domains:
  - v0.example.com
  - example.com
